# p2-ascent.drv - Phase 2 tour: lift off from an atmospheric surface port and
# climb straight up through the cloud deck into space.
#
# Verifies: clouds2 (W5b) the sky deck seen from the pad, from inside it and
# from above it, and that the deck hands over to the orbit view of the clouds
# (procfx PF_CLOUDS) at 1.25R without a jump.
# Run:  tools/p2shots --routes ascent --base BASE --branch BRANCH
# Expect: 01 the pad (front view) after 15 s landed, 02 the rear view just
#         after the climb starts, 03 at the deck (d/R about 1.0020),
#         04 just above it (about 1.004), 05 high (about 1.19, below the
#         1.25R hand-over), 06 space (about 1.39).  The rear view looks
#         straight down once the nose is up.
# The d/R figures were read with FE2_CLDBG on an unloaded machine; the game
# clock follows wall time, so a busy machine moves them a little.
# Each shot pauses the game (Esc) and resumes it at 1x (Shift+F1); the
# pointer is parked off the controls so no hover tip is drawn.
# Log markers: padtime..padend (landed, for frame timing), climb..climbend.

wait 6000
key space
wait 2000
key 2             # start position 2: landed at a surface port with an atmosphere
wait 11000
mouse 2 120
log padtime
wait 15000
log padend
sdlkey esc
wait 600
shot 01-pad
sdlkey f1 shift
mouse 57 193      # comms: ask for launch clearance
wait 300
click 200
wait 2500
mouse 171 57
wait 300
click 200
wait 3000
mouse 263 193     # lift off
wait 300
click 200
wait 2000
mouse 2 120
wait 7000
press right       # pitch the nose up (right button + mouse)
move 0 -8 50 20
release right
wait 300
press right
move 0 -8 50 20
release right
wait 300
press right
move 0 8 150 20
release right
wait 300
press right
move 0 8 100 20
release right
wait 300
mouse 8 193       # the view icon: rear view, straight down once climbing
wait 300
click 200
wait 2500
mouse 2 120
wait 300
sdlkey esc
wait 600
shot 02-low
sdlkey f1 shift
log climb
keydown return    # full thrust
wait 8400
sdlkey esc
wait 600
shot 03-deck
sdlkey f1 shift
wait 2800
sdlkey esc
wait 600
shot 04-above
sdlkey f1 shift
sdlkey f2 shift   # 10x
wait 12000
sdlkey esc
wait 600
shot 05-high
sdlkey f1 shift
sdlkey f2 shift
wait 5000
sdlkey esc
wait 600
shot 06-space
log climbend
quit
